    "long_instructions": "### The Asynchronous Kitchen\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. **Read**: Look closely at the milliseconds (e.g. `2000`, `5000`) inside the code.\r\n\r\n2. **Predict**: In what order will the chef complete the tasks based on their timers? Submit your prediction in the box below.\r\n\r\n3. **Run**: Click the 'Run Routine' button to see the actual order in which the chef completes the tasks."
